the same for alice and carlos and all the users&nbsp;
and of course like we can represent this on a map&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:33.120
as a trajectory so we have the first point for bob&nbsp;
which would be t1 l1 and i don't i don't know like&nbsp;&nbsp;

